#. Description of the plugin
#: exelearning.php
msgid ""
"Plugin to support eXeLearning .elp files in WordPress. Upload, manage and "
"embed eXeLearning content."
msgstr ""
"Plugin zur Unterstützung von eXeLearning .elp-Dateien in WordPress. "
"Hochladen, Verwalten und Einbetten von eXeLearning-Inhalten."

